  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 reached end of support on June 1st, 2026, and no longer receives updates, including security fixes. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Wickr now provides a suite of admin APIs to allow you to programmatically manage secure communication for Wickr networks at scale. These APIs enable you to automate administrative workflows including user lifecycle management, network configuration, and security group administration.",
